        <mxCell id="d7gty-hZnX5AW48Pm6Gb-11" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;hr data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;68&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;70&quot; data-end=&quot;96&quot;&gt;Functional Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ol data-start=&quot;98&quot; data-end=&quot;737&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;98&quot; data-end=&quot;184&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;101&quot; data-end=&quot;121&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;101&quot; data-end=&quot;121&quot;&gt;Initiate Payment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;125&quot; data-end=&quot;184&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;125&quot; data-end=&quot;184&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;127&quot; data-end=&quot;184&quot;&gt;Create a payment for an order (amount, currency, method)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;186&quot; data-end=&quot;253&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;189&quot; data-end=&quot;214&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;189&quot; data-end=&quot;214&quot;&gt;Choose Payment Method&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;218&quot; data-end=&quot;253&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;218&quot; data-end=&quot;253&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;220&quot; data-end=&quot;253&quot;&gt;UPI / Card / NetBanking / Wallet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;255&quot; data-end=&quot;394&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;258&quot; data-end=&quot;289&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;258&quot; data-end=&quot;289&quot;&gt;Process Payment via Gateway&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;293&quot; data-end=&quot;394&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;293&quot; data-end=&quot;352&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;295&quot; data-end=&quot;352&quot;&gt;Send payment request to a gateway (Razorpay/Stripe/etc.)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;356&quot; data-end=&quot;394&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;358&quot; data-end=&quot;394&quot;&gt;Get a payment reference/redirect/QR.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;396&quot; data-end=&quot;487&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;399&quot; data-end=&quot;423&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;399&quot; data-end=&quot;423&quot;&gt;Track Payment Status&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;427&quot; data-end=&quot;487&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;427&quot; data-end=&quot;487&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;429&quot; data-end=&quot;487&quot;&gt;Store status: &lt;code data-start=&quot;443&quot; data-end=&quot;454&quot;&gt;INITIATED&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-start=&quot;456&quot; data-end=&quot;465&quot;&gt;PENDING&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-start=&quot;467&quot; data-end=&quot;476&quot;&gt;SUCCESS&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-start=&quot;478&quot; data-end=&quot;486&quot;&gt;FAILED&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;489&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;492&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;492&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;Handle Gateway Callback (Webhook)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;533&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;533&quot; data-end=&quot;572&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;535&quot; data-end=&quot;572&quot;&gt;Receive success/failure from gateway.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;576&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;578&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;Update status in system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;674&quot; data-end=&quot;737&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;677&quot; data-end=&quot;692&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;677&quot; data-end=&quot;692&quot;&gt;Notify User&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;696&quot; data-end=&quot;737&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;696&quot; data-end=&quot;737&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;698&quot; data-end=&quot;737&quot;&gt;Send message on success/failure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;739&quot; data-end=&quot;742&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;744&quot; data-end=&quot;774&quot;&gt;Non-Functional Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol data-start=&quot;776&quot; data-end=&quot;1277&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;776&quot; data-end=&quot;854&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;779&quot; data-end=&quot;791&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;779&quot; data-end=&quot;791&quot;&gt;Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;795&quot; data-end=&quot;854&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;795&quot; data-end=&quot;854&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;854&quot;&gt;HTTPS, secure storage, don’t store card details directly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;856&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;859&quot; data-end=&quot;874&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;859&quot; data-end=&quot;874&quot;&gt;Reliability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;878&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;878&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;880&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;No duplicate payment for the same order (idempotency).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;936&quot; data-end=&quot;1033&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;939&quot; data-end=&quot;955&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;939&quot; data-end=&quot;955&quot;&gt;Availability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;959&quot; data-end=&quot;1033&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;959&quot; data-end=&quot;1033&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;961&quot; data-end=&quot;1033&quot;&gt;System should be up and process payments most of the time (high uptime).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1035&quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1053&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1053&quot;&gt;Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1057&quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1057&quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1059&quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;Payment initiation should be fast (low latency).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1109&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1112&quot; data-end=&quot;1127&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1112&quot; data-end=&quot;1127&quot;&gt;Scalability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1131&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1131&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1133&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot;&gt;Should handle more users/payments by adding servers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1187&quot; data-end=&quot;1277&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1190&quot; data-end=&quot;1207&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1190&quot; data-end=&quot;1207&quot;&gt;Audit/Logging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1211&quot; data-end=&quot;1277&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1211&quot; data-end=&quot;1277&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1213&quot; data-end=&quot;1277&quot;&gt;Store logs of payment requests and status changes for debugging&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="950" width="511.75" x="-791.75" y="-2920" as="geometry" />
